---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="relative bg-ink text-cream pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-10 px-6 md:px-10">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-10">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" class="w-8 h-8" aria-hidden="true">
          <g fill="#E8A3A3">
            <ellipse cx="13" cy="11" rx="3.2" ry="8" />
            <ellipse cx="27" cy="11" rx="3.2" ry="8" />
            <circle cx="20" cy="26" r="9" />
          </g>
        </svg>
        <span class="font-display text-[20px] italic">Rabbit Specialty Clinic</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 font-mincho text-[14px] leading-[2] text-cream/70 max-w-[42ch]">
        小さな命のためだけに設計された、うさぎ専門の総合動物病院。東京・渋谷から、世界中のうさぎオーナーの声に耳を澄ませます。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="col-span-6 md:col-span-3">
      <div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.28em] uppercase text-cream/50 mb-4">Contact</div>
      <div class="font-mincho text-[14px] leading-[2]">
        〒150-0001<br/>
        東京都渋谷区神宮前 0-0-0<br/>
        Rabbit Building 3F
      </div>
      <a href="tel:0312345678" class="mt-4 inline-block font-display italic text-[22px] hover:text-rose transition-colors" data-hover="link">03-1234-5678</a>
    </div>

    <div class="col-span-6 md:col-span-3">
      <div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.28em] uppercase text-cream/50 mb-4">Follow</div>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px]">
        <li><a href="#" data-hover="link" class="hover:text-rose transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">Instagram <span class="text-cream/40">↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="#" data-hover="link" class="hover:text-rose transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">X / Twitter <span class="text-cream/40">↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="#" data-hover="link" class="hover:text-rose transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">YouTube <span class="text-cream/40">↗</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:reservation@rabbit-clinic.example" data-hover="link" class="hover:text-rose transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">Mail <span class="text-cream/40">↗</span></a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-cream/15 grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-cream/50">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6">© {year} Rabbit Specialty Clinic. All Rights Reserved.</div>
    <div class="col-span-6 md:col-span-3">Designed with 🐰 in Tokyo</div>
    <div class="col-span-6 md:col-span-3 text-right">Portfolio / 2026</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Huge wordmark -->
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="mt-12 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="font-display italic text-[22vw] leading-[0.9] text-cream/10 tracking-tightest whitespace-nowrap select-none">
      Rabbit · Clinic · Tokyo
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
